      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Burleson hosts the Burleson Honey Tour Festival, celebrating the area’s long‑standing beekeeping tradition.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
